{"id":"wb-6-628","name":"商水寿圣寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"商水寿圣寺塔","text":"商水寿圣寺塔，位于中华人民共和国河南省周口市商水县郝岗乡常社店村寿圣寺旧址，与西华县逍遥镇隔沙河相望。该塔始建于北宋明道二年（1033年），1986年11月被公布为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2006年5月被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%95%86%E6%B0%B4%E5%AF%BF%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":90638856,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90638856","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/64fe09e8dc07982faf526676.jpg","title":"20240825_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Shangshui.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240825_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Shangshui.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/20240825_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Shangshui.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​商水寿圣寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}